I'm enjoying playing through the Sporkhack Castle and new Gehennom.
If all goes well, I can maybe ascend before the save-break.  I have
some questions:

Is there still a wand of wishing in the castle?!  I like the new
method of obfuscation around the castle prize but with the
armed(wanded) guards in the turrets and the extra wands in the chests
I had quite a supply of wands for polypiling.  I did find a wand of
death in the castle chest but I am almost positive that I engrave
tested or identified each wand before throwing it on my polypile
piles.  But at the end of it, there was no wand of wishing.  I thought
that perhaps the castle now has, in addition to a supply of random
wands, one of a wand of death or a wand of wishing.  Or maybe I messed
up.

Speaking of polypiling, I was hoping for a silver short sword but I
only got a silver dagger.  I presume the silver short swords are quite
rare?

I found a pair of "thigh" boots quite early in the game but didn't
recognize them as being different from "high" boots.  The names seem a
bit too similar for someone who isn't aware that there has been an
additional type of boot aded.  "Bunny slippers" maybe? No? too
silly?
